{
 "_held_out_warrant": "The kit's gamma is measured PURELY from promoter DNA (NN-stacking dG37, SantaLucia 1998, GRCh38 TSS-2000..+500), and was frozen before any expression data was consulted. The Replogle CRISPRi pseudobulk expresses none of that DNA-thermodynamic information, so it is a genuinely held-out target for the (A) map. No parameter or gamma was tuned to it.",
 "_panel_rule": "Panel = union of ALL seven frozen kit gamma atlases (neuro, onco, neurodegen, rna-carrier, imprint, germline, immune), deduplicated by symbol (first-wins; no gamma conflicts), matched to perturbations by EXACT HGNC symbol with the single documented alias GBA1->GBA. Declared before scoring; not chosen to favour any result.",
 "_panel_size": 75,
 "_prediction_sign_locked": "R19 (A)-map prediction, locked BEFORE scoring: a deeper-barrier (higher-gamma) promoter resists the knockdown drive, so higher gamma -> more transcript remaining -> Spearman rho(gamma, fold_expr) > 0. A null or negative rho is a valid honest outcome.",
 "_source": {
  "assembly_note": "perturbation labels parsed as '{idx}_{SYMBOL}_{P1P2|P1}_{ENSG}'; symbol = field[1]; NON-TARGETING controls excluded.",
  "doi": "10.1016/j.cell.2022.05.013",
  "figshare_article": "20029387",
  "figshare_base_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/",
  "readout_column": "obs/fold_expr = ON-TARGET fraction of transcript remaining after CRISPRi (1.0=no knockdown, 0.0=complete); obs/control_expr = matched non-targeting baseline level.",
  "study": "Replogle et al., Mapping information-rich genotype-phenotype landscapes with genome-scale Perturb-seq, Cell 185(14):2559-2575 (2022)"
 },
 "_what": "VP Inheritance Kit -- (B) VALIDATION scoring sheet (held-out). Cached matched-panel rows used to score the kit's no-tuning (A)-map gamma-ordering against REAL on-target CRISPRi knockdown depth. This file holds ONLY the held-out measurements (fold_expr/control_expr) for the genes that intersect the kit's frozen gamma atlases; gamma itself is NOT stored here as truth -- it is re-read from the frozen inherited/*_gamma.json atlases at score time. Nothing is fitted to these numbers; the kit scores frozen predictions against them.",
